iders, front desk staff, extended care team, IT assistance, and overall support from Stanford Health Care leadership. By breaking down the intervention into these categories, we can focus on increasing baseline screening, as well as improving treatment and follow-up care.  "	0	4	4	15	1237.5	4	5	0	1	1	39.056526	40.258675								
