ystems. Speciifc examples, they contacted all patients to identify needs; scheduled them with both PCP/BH if needed; and tried to reconnect all BH patients with BH support via telehealth. Prior to COVID, they talked about creating educaitonal resources for hyptensive patetns and displaying these resources on the TVs in the lobby possibly using youtube presentations; having materials in the bathrooms; and coming up with an easy to understand themometer building in patient resutls to provide feedback regariding hypertension screenings. "	10	0	10	21	1575	4	4	0	1	0	30.708	29.600586								
